 BEGINSET
 FCC-sd
6 2 8 0
s
d
 RYD
 ! Fitted on a 12-direction (fcc) Bethe lattice to the CRYSTAL23 LSDA DOS of
 ! ferromagnetic fcc Fe, a = 3.515 A, with the sd basis + ECP of the ANT Fe wire
 ! (s and d projected DOS of both spins and the 2.83 muB moment). No overlaps.
 ISPIN =            1
